							<div class="col connect" data-image-url="https://pxl-elginedu.terminalfour.net/filters:format(webp)/prod01/cdn-pxl-elginedu-prod/media/elginedu/index/scholarships.jpg"> <a class="connect-link" href="/pay-for-college/scholarships/" title="Generous Scholarships"><span class="connect-link-label fs-5">Generous Scholarships<span class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></a><p class="connect-text align-bottom">Get a great education that opens doors and boosts your income &mdash; all while saving thousands on your degree.</p></div>

<div class="col connect" data-image-url="https://pxl-elginedu.terminalfour.net/filters:format(webp)/prod01/cdn-pxl-elginedu-prod/media/elginedu/index/student-activities.jpg"> <a class="connect-link" href="/info/elginedu-sections2/student-life/" title="Vibrant Campus Life"><span class="connect-link-label fs-5">Vibrant Campus Life<span class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></a><p class="connect-text align-bottom">Taking classes on campus gives ECC a strong sense of community. You can also choose online courses to fit your busy schedule.</p></div>

<div class="col connect" data-image-url="https://pxl-elginedu.terminalfour.net/filters:format(webp)/prod01/cdn-pxl-elginedu-prod/media/elginedu/index/community-connections.jpg"> <a class="connect-link" href="/community/" title="Community Connections"><span class="connect-link-label fs-5">Community Connections<span class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></a><p class="connect-text align-bottom">We&rsquo;re part of the community and help prepare future leaders. Our ties with local companies give you job connections when you finish school.</p></div>







