    <img src="https://pxl-elginedu.terminalfour.net/filters:format(webp)/prod01/cdn-pxl-elginedu-prod/media/elginedu/news-and-events/ecc-in-the-news/original/Zach-Lorenz-800X500.jpg" class="flex-shrink-0 me-3 p-0 img-thumbnail shadow-sm d-none d-sm-block ls-is-cached lazyloaded" alt="Zach Lorenz"> </div>
					<div class="card-body">
			    		<p class="card-text">Zach Lorenz became the owner of Lorenz Calibration in October 2024, following his father&rsquo;s death. Now, the young business owner is navigating everything from hiring his first employee to expanding the company&rsquo;s services, and he sees ECC as a potential partner.</p>
